Z||000001||Tonker||10-29-2001||12:26 PM||||What size is the engine in the Turbo Sprint? I have a metro and was thinking of trying to swap the engine next summer.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000002||GT Bastard||10-29-2001||01:32 PM||||It's 1.0 litre 3cyl...  Basically the same as the early style metro motor with lower compression pistons.  It uses and IHI turbo with an intercooler and blow-off valve.  0-60 comes in 8.7 seconds, 1/4 mile in 16.2 seconds.  I'm adding a boost controller fuel pressure regulator and manual boost controller. Stock boost is 7.5 psi, and I'd like to see 10psi.  Good luck finding information on these engines...  There's virtually nothing useful online.  I've literally searched hours on multiple search engines, and found 2 or 3 useful sites, but none of them had very specific information.  ||||reg||1
